  "question": {
    "text": "If in a class there are <math><mn>200</mn></math> students in which <math><mn>120</mn></math> take Mathematics, <math><mn>90</mn></math> take Physics, <math><mn>60</mn></math> take Chemistry, <math><mn>50</mn></math> take Mathematics &amp; Physics, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn></math> take Mathematics &amp; Chemistry,&nbsp;<math><mn>43</mn></math>&nbsp;take Physics &amp; Chemistry and&nbsp;<math><mn>38</mn></math> take Mathematics, Physics &amp; Chemistry, then the number of students who have taken exactly one subject is"
